# Copyright — the FULL English novel ONLY.
#
# SETTLED, do not re-narrow: the incipit excerpt we analyse (~680 words, the
# same passage as texts/incipit_it.txt) and everything produced from it — the
# specs, the embargo and lemma/zipf tables built from it, and the generations
# and scored cells derived from it — are fair use for scholarly analysis and
# ARE tracked. Excluding them cost us a day: the English cells lived only on
# hippias, so rebuilding the production table on another machine silently
# produced 18 cells instead of 26.
#
# What must never land here is a COMPLETE text of the translation.
texts/*colquhoun*
texts/*moore*
texts/*betrothed*
texts/*_full.txt
texts/*_complete.txt

# --print-prompt dumps: excluded because they are regenerable, not for copyright
results/prompt_*.json

